// Here-strings — ITEMS.md #10
// Feed a string directly as stdin to a command.

// Basic here-string
sort <<< "banana apple cherry"

// With a variable
@msg = "hello world"
cat <<< @msg

// With interpolated string
@name = "dush"
cat <<< "welcome to @name"

// Pipe after here-string
sort <<< "cherry banana apple"
